# DeepSeek Harness (dsh) - default-privacy run.
# DSH has two OTel exporters; both are pointed at the local collector here.
#
# 1. @loongsuite/dsh-plugin (traces + metrics, OTLP/HTTP protobuf). Must be added to
#    the headless profile once: see README "DeepSeek Harness (extra)".
#    https://github.com/loongsuite/dsh-plugin (v0.1.3)
#    Shared base URL; the plugin appends /v1/traces and /v1/metrics itself.
#    OTEL_SERVICE_NAME is deliberately unset (plugin default: deepseek-harness).
#    Content capture is off by default.
OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=http://127.0.0.1:4318

# 2. DSH's built-in dsh-session-telemetry-otel (logs only), mounted by dsh-base.
#    Default mode is FEEDBACK_ONLY: nothing is uploaded unless the user records
#    /feedback, which headless never does. Its default URL is DeepSeek's own
#    https://harness-telemetry.deepseeksvc.com/v1/logs, so point it here anyway:
#    whatever it does send stays on this machine. Needs the full signal path.
DSH_TELEMETRY_OTLP_URL=http://127.0.0.1:4318/v1/logs
